# Runtime dependencies imported by server.py.
#
# requirements.txt (runtime) and requirements-dev.txt (CI) are pinned,
# hash-checked lockfiles compiled from the .in files. Do not edit them by
# hand: change an .in file, then regenerate both for Python 3.12 (the
# version CI tests):
#
#   uv pip compile --python-version 3.12 --generate-hashes requirements.in -o requirements.txt
#   uv pip compile --python-version 3.12 --generate-hashes requirements-dev.in -o requirements-dev.txt
#
# Dependabot updates the .in and .txt files together, so pins can no longer
# drift into impossible combinations (main had boto3 1.42.42 pinned next to
# s3transfer 0.19.0, which boto3 1.42 does not accept).

